    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341190/extras/e5bd3c671bd316d31dda8101463507bf.avif?t=1753350035\" data-has-big width=800 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is the ultimate Maze Game. The mazes are procedurally generated, and are always unique. Sandbox Style: There are plenty of options and features to create an experience to your liking. Play alone or with compete against your friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341190/extras/506eefd94da5d0469335d810623674b7.avif?t=1753350035\" data-has-big width=800 height=41 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Configure rounds:</strong> do you want a quick competition or a long lasting Tournament? It's up to You!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Configure speed:</strong> If you are looking for a relaxing experience play it slow. If you are in for breathtaking action crank up the speed to maximum! Or choose something in between, it's up to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Configure the maze:</strong> Generate small mazes for a quick challenge or really big ones, and make your brain sweat! Add Loops to create Shortcuts and have more then one way out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341190/extras/d48790b052715ef5fd9f18437feee6bc.avif?t=1753350035\" alt=\"Different maze sizes\" width=616 height=126 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Singleplayer and local as well as online multiplayer for up to four human and/or AI competitors.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete with AI:</strong>\u00a0See if you can outsmart up to three AIs and be the first to reach the Goal!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341190/extras/e2b6c39f6d11187087215cee6bcb325c.avif?t=1753350035\" alt=\"Want some action?\" width=800 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341190/extras/d543a659b45a8368a92f214f90375c9d.poster.avif?t=1753350035\" aria-label=\"Maze with pickups, hunters and teleports\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341190/extras/d543a659b45a8368a92f214f90375c9d.webm?t=1753350035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>look at these additional features for single and multiplayer games</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keys:</strong>\u00a0Gather keys to unlock the Goal. Pick them up at random locations or make them move around, so you have to hunt them.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teleporters:</strong>\u00a0They come in color-coded pairs and provide further shortcuts. Figure out the shortest way on a more complex level.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunters:</strong>\u00a0Don't let them catch you. Avoid them by using teleporters, hide from them in safe zones or use various pickups to fend them of.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick Ups:</strong>\u00a0And here the real fun begins! Gather eight unique pickups to get an advantage against your contenders and the hunters: Jump through walls, get extra impetus with the turbo, lay mines and laserbombs and more. Use them quick and wisely, and victory shall be yours!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ambient Soundscapes:</strong>\u00a0Add rain or other noises if you live with tinnitus, or for a little stress relief in general.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341190/extras/e5bd3c671bd316d31dda8101463507bf.avif?t=1753350035\" data-has-big width=800 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is the ultimate Maze Game. The mazes are procedurally generated, and are always unique. Sandbox Style: There are plenty of options and features to create an experience to your liking. Play alone or with compete against your friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341190/extras/506eefd94da5d0469335d810623674b7.avif?t=1753350035\" data-has-big width=800 height=41 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Configure rounds:</strong> do you want a quick competition or a long lasting Tournament? It's up to You!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Configure speed:</strong> If you are looking for a relaxing experience play it slow. If you are in for breathtaking action crank up the speed to maximum! Or choose something in between, it's up to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Configure the maze:</strong> Generate small mazes for a quick challenge or really big ones, and make your brain sweat! Add Loops to create Shortcuts and have more then one way out.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341190/extras/d48790b052715ef5fd9f18437feee6bc.avif?t=1753350035\" alt=\"Different maze sizes\" width=616 height=126 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer:</strong> Singleplayer and local as well as online multiplayer for up to four human and/or AI competitors.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete with AI:</strong>\u00a0See if you can outsmart up to three AIs and be the first to reach the Goal!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341190/extras/e2b6c39f6d11187087215cee6bcb325c.avif?t=1753350035\" alt=\"Want some action?\" width=800 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341190/extras/d543a659b45a8368a92f214f90375c9d.poster.avif?t=1753350035\" aria-label=\"Maze with pickups, hunters and teleports\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341190/extras/d543a659b45a8368a92f214f90375c9d.webm?t=1753350035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>look at these additional features for single and multiplayer games</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keys:</strong>\u00a0Gather keys to unlock the Goal. Pick them up at random locations or make them move around, so you have to hunt them.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teleporters:</strong>\u00a0They come in color-coded pairs and provide further shortcuts. Figure out the shortest way on a more complex level.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunters:</strong>\u00a0Don't let them catch you. Avoid them by using teleporters, hide from them in safe zones or use various pickups to fend them of.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick Ups:</strong>\u00a0And here the real fun begins! Gather eight unique pickups to get an advantage against your contenders and the hunters: Jump through walls, get extra impetus with the turbo, lay mines and laserbombs and more. Use them quick and wisely, and victory shall be yours!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ambient Soundscapes:</strong>\u00a0Add rain or other noises if you live with tinnitus, or for a little stress relief in general.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
